# GoShop Beta — Environment Template
# BismiLLAH Ar-Rahman Ar-Roheem. Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values.
# This file is safe to commit (it contains NO secrets). The `.env` file is gitignored.
#
# Architecture: the SPA is 100% static (Cloudflare Pages). There is NO app
# server — every dynamic need lives in lightbase (Edge Functions + REST).
# See DEPLOYMENT.md and edge-functions/.

# ---- Frontend build-time (public, no secrets) ----
# VITE_LIGHTBASE_URL — lightbase engine origin. The default is the live
# lightbase host; for local development set it to http://localhost:4400.
VITE_LIGHTBASE_URL=https://lightbase-10133292663.development.catalystappsail.com
# VITE_LIGHTBASE_PROJECT — lightbase project id (identifier, not a secret).
VITE_LIGHTBASE_PROJECT=goshop-beta
# VITE_LIGHTBASE_BROWSER_KEY — OPTIONAL read-only key for browser-direct
# catalog reads (coalescing client with IndexedDB ETag cache). Mint with:
#   node scripts/lightbase-provision.mjs key
# Collections-restricted (products/categories/stores/languages/currencies/
# blogs/help_articles/reviews) and read-scoped, so it is safe to bake at
# build time. NEVER bake a write/root key into the bundle.
VITE_LIGHTBASE_BROWSER_KEY=
VITE_APP_NAME=GoShop
VITE_CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=
VITE_CLOUDINARY_UPLOAD_PRESET=

# ---- Server-side (Edge Function env — set via scripts/lightbase-deploy-functions.mjs) ----
# These are NOT read by the SPA. They are baked into the lightbase functions
# at deploy time from the operator environment:
#   GOSHOP_JWT_SECRET           — signs the app JWT (auth functions); REQUIRED
#   GOSHOP_APP_URL              — public app origin (payment redirect URLs)
#   GOSHOP_BIRRPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET — BirrPay webhook HMAC (v1 SHA-256 / v2 SHA-512)
#   GOSHOP_BIRRPAY_SECRET_KEY / GOSHOP_BIRRPAY_BASE_URL / GOSHOP_BIRRPAY_CURRENCY
#   GOSHOP_PAYSTACK_SECRET_KEY / GOSHOP_FLUTTERWAVE_SECRET_KEY
#   GOSHOP_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID / GOSHOP_RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET
#   GOSHOP_PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID / GOSHOP_PAYPAL_CLIENT_SECRET
#   GOSHOP_ADMIN_EMAIL / GOSHOP_SUPPORT_EMAIL
# Without a gateway key the payments-initiate function disables that gateway;
# wallet and COD always work. Leave secrets empty in this template — provide
# them as real environment variables when running the deploy script.

# ---- CORS (ops-side, on the lightbase instance) ----
# The engine pins CORS to exact allowlisted origins (never wildcard). The
# lightbase instance serving this app must include the Pages origin in
# LIGHTBASE_ALLOWED_ORIGINS (e.g. "https://goshop-beta.pages.dev").
